#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/rickroll.js:215
msgid "Create the Wi-Fi network and start the portal."
msgstr "建立 Wi-Fi 網路並啟動入口網頁。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/rickroll.js:361
msgid "Creates an open Wi-Fi network that has no internet access. Every web page on this network shows a portal page. Its button plays the video that you uploaded."
msgstr "建立一個沒有網際網路連線的開放 Wi-Fi 網路。在這個網路上開啟任何網頁都會顯示入口網頁。網頁上的按鈕會播放你上傳的影片。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/rickroll.js:294
msgid "DNS port"
msgstr "DNS 連接埠"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/rickroll.js:182
msgid "Delete the video from the router? The portal page then has no video."
msgstr "要從路由器刪除影片嗎？刪除後入口網頁沒有影片可播放。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/rickroll.js:348
