msgid "Expecting a port number from 1024 to 65535"
msgstr "請輸入 1024 到 65535 的連接埠號碼"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/rickroll.js:262
msgid "Expecting an IPv4 address without leading zeros"
msgstr "請輸入 IPv4 位址，數字不可有前導零"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/rickroll.js:272
msgid "From /16 to /24. Devices get the host numbers 100 to 249 of this subnet."
msgstr "範圍為 /16 到 /24。裝置會取得這個子網路中主機編號 100 到 249 的位址。"

